@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
component "Script UI / Command" as UI
component ScriptManager as Manager
component "ScriptExecutor" as Executor
component "IContextScript" as Script
component "IScriptApi" as Api
component "Diary API" as Diary
component "Tracker API" as Tracker
database "Core diary data" as DB
cloud "Tracker services" as Remote

rectangle "EditorScriptContext\n- Scope: ScriptScope\n- Target: ScriptTarget\n- Parameters" as Context
rectangle "ScriptScope\n- Granularity\n- StartDate\n- EndDate" as Scope
rectangle "ScriptTarget\n- Kind\n- PluginId\n- InstanceId\n- TargetId" as Target

User --> UI : choose script and scope
UI --> Manager : ExecuteContext
Manager --> Manager : validate scope and target
Manager --> Executor : create execution context
Executor --> Script : Execute(context, api)
Executor --> Api : create restricted host API
Api --> Diary
Api --> Tracker
Diary --> DB
Tracker --> Remote

UI ..> Context : constructs
Context *-- Scope
Context *-- Target

note right of Context
Template is intentionally absent.
Templates are selected and applied
by the host/editor, not scripts.
end note

note right of Target
Tracker targets use the composite identity:
PluginId + InstanceId + optional TargetId
end note
@enduml
